# Org listings (session memory 2026-09-10)

Companion to `ecke-platform-pivot.mdc`. Same org login owns **events + one shop + one dungeon/club**. Do not invent parallel tables.

## Tables (extend, don’t replace)
- Events → `public.events` (`organization_id`)
- Shop → `public.vendors` (`organization_id`; unique one-shop-per-org)
- Place → `public.dungeon_venues` (`organization_id`; unique one-place-per-org). C2K rows keep `c2k_source_id`. Migration: `supabase/migrations/20260910140000_ecke_org_place_profile.sql`

## Routes
- Dashboard `/dashboard` — three cards: Events / conventions, Vendor shop, Dungeon / club
- `/events/create`, `/events/manage/[slug]`, `/vendors/my-shop`, `/dungeons/my-place`
- Public: `/events/{slug}`, `/vendors/{slug}`, `/dungeons/{slug}`. Drafts noindex; published → sitemap + IndexNow

